  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and shallow fry the boiled eggs with the turmeric until lightly golden; set aside.",
    "In the same oil fry the onions until golden, saving a third for garnish.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste, green chillies, tomatoes, chilli powder, biryani masala and salt and cook until soft.",
    "Stir in the curd and half the herbs and cook for 3 minutes, then add the eggs.",
    "Boil the soaked rice with the bay leaf in salted water until 70 percent cooked and drain.",
    "Layer the rice over the egg masala, scatter the remaining herbs and fried onion, dot with the ghee and seal the pot.",
    "Cook on low heat for 15 minutes, rest 5 minutes and serve."
  ]
